// Refreshes one connected account's posts: new posts appear, engagement counts update, and Instagram and Facebook media links in platform_media are renewed. Instagram covers up to the 500 most recent posts, Facebook up to the 500 most recent per Page; other platforms cover up to the 25 most recent. Returns immediately: poll GET /accounts/{account_id}/sync until state leaves "syncing", then read the posts. A sync already running for the account is returned as-is. Each account can start a sync once every 15 minutes, and each day your plan allows 10 syncs per brand it includes (Enterprise is unlimited); the count resets at midnight UTC.
